{"@context":"http://iiif.io/api/presentation/2/context.json","@id":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grecolatinovivo-create/emendando-catalogo/manifesti/data/manifesti/kbdk/object953485.json","@type":"sc:Manifest","label":"GKS 718 folio : Historia Hammaburgensis ecclesiæ IV : Descriptio Insularum Aqvilonis.","metadata":[{"label":"Segnatura","value":"GKS 718 folio"},{"label":"Titolo","value":"Historia Hammaburgensis ecclesiæ IV : Descriptio Insularum Aqvilonis."},{"label":"Autori","value":"Adam Bremensis (Adam af Bremen)"},{"label":"Datazione","value":"1400-1499"},{"label":"Lingue","value":"Latin"},{"label":"Descrizione fisica","value":"1 bind, 8 blade; 300 x 215 mm"},{"label":"Note","value":"Proveniens: Tyskland / Cismar KLoster / Gottorp Slot (erobret 1713) / Indlemmet i KB 1735. ; Blad 8v ubeskrevet. Før 1735 var dette håndskrift indbundet sammen med GKS 380 folio et GKS 338 folio ; Efter titlen er skrevet med nyere hånd: \"ex Adami bremensis lib. 1\" og med endnu nyere hånd: \"exarat. circa 1434.\" Er fjerde bog af Adam af Bremens større værk \"Historia ecclesiastica\", men forkortet og bearbejdet. ; Beskrevet i: E. Gigas, Katalog over Det store kongelige Bibliotheks Haandskrifter vedrørende Norden, særlig Danmark I (1903) p. 3; E. Jørgensen, Catalogus Codicum Latinorum Medii Ævi Bibliothecæ Regiæ Hafniensis (1926) p. 403; John Erichsen, Udsigt over den gamle Manuscript-Samling i det store Kgl. Bibliothek (1786) p. 89; Arch. d. Ges. f. ält. deutsche geschichtsk. VI (1838) p. 854, VII (1839) p. 455; Monumenta Germaniæ historica inde ab anno Christi 500 usque ad annum 1500 ... edidit G. Pertz, VII (se Lappenbergs fortale til hans udgave af Adam af Bremen, optr. i den nye udgave ved G. Waitz, 1876); Zeitschr. d. Ges. f. Schlesw.-Holst.-Lauenb. Gesch., XIV (1884), p. 13."},{"label":"Collezione","value":"GKS (Gammel Kongelig Samling)"},{"label":"Diritti","value":"Materialet er fri af ophavsret"}],"attribution":"Det Kgl. Bibliotek, København (Materialet er fri af ophavsret). Manifesto scritto dal catalogo di Emendando con le immagini IIIF della biblioteca (kb-images.kb.dk).","related":"https://digitalesamlinger.kb.dk/manus/vmanus/2011/dec/ha/object953485/en/","sequences":[{"@id":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grecolatinovivo-create/emendando-catalogo/manifesti/data/manifesti/kbdk/object953485.json/s0","@type":"sc:Sequence","canvases":[{"@id":"https://kb-images.kb.dk/DAMJP2/DAM/OnlineMasterArkiv/0000/953/485/GKS-2_0718_0001","@type":"sc:Canvas","label":"1","width":6806,"height":9398,"images":[{"@type":"oa:Annotation","motivation":"sc:painting","on":"https://kb-images.kb.dk/DAMJP2/DAM/OnlineMasterArkiv/0000/953/485/GKS-2_0718_0001","resource":{"@id":"https://kb-images.kb.dk/DAMJP2/DAM/OnlineMasterArkiv/0000/953/485/GKS-2_0718_0001/full/full/0/default.jpg","@type":"dctypes:Image","format":"image/jpeg","service":{"@context":"http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json","@id":"https://kb-images.kb.dk/DAMJP2/DAM/OnlineMasterArkiv/0000/953/485/GKS-2_0718_0001","profile":"http://iiif.io/api/image/2/level2.json"}}}]},{"@id":"https://kb-images.kb.dk/DAMJP2/DAM/OnlineMasterArkiv/0000/953/486/GKS-2_0718_0002","@type":"sc:Canvas","label":"2","width":6806,"height":9398,"images":[{"@type":"oa:Annotation","motivation":"sc:painting","on":"https://kb-images.kb.dk/DAMJP2/DAM/OnlineMasterArkiv/0000/953/486/GKS-2_0718_0002","resource":{"@id":"https://kb-images.kb.dk/DAMJP2/DAM/OnlineMasterArkiv/0000/953/486/GKS-2_0718_0002/full/full/0/default.jpg","@type":"dctypes:Image","format":"image/jpeg","service":{"@context":"http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json","@id":"https://kb-images.kb.dk/DAMJP2/DAM/OnlineMasterArkiv/0000/953/486/GKS-2_0718_0002","profile":"http://iiif.io/api/image/2/level2.json"}}}]},{"@id":"https://kb-images.kb.dk/DAMJP2/DAM/OnlineMasterArkiv/0000/953/487/GKS-2_0718_0003","@type":"sc:Canvas","label":"3","width":6806,"height":9398,"images":[{"@type":"oa:Annotation","motivation":"sc:painting","on":"https://kb-images.kb.dk/DAMJP2/DAM/On